# 40. Role Dashboards: Doctors, Surgeons & Critical Care

Roles: `doctor`, `resident_doctor`, `surgeon`, `anaesthetist`, `icu_doctor`, `emergency`, `ot_coordinator`, `ot_technician`, `psychiatrist`, `doctor_portal`.
**Family rule:** My-day cockpit, results must-ack, DDI/allergy safety at prescribing, e-sign + QR verify, never show fabricated counts; treating-patient scope + break-glass.

### Doctor (Consultant, hospital) (`doctor`)
- **Purpose:** My-day cockpit: OPD queue, ward rounds, results inbox, orders, discharges, OT, earnings.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `DoctorDashboard` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 2 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 2 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** OPD waiting + seen today; IPD patients (mine) + NEWS2 high-risk count; Unreviewed results (critical first); Pending orders/consults; Discharges awaiting my approval; OT cases today; Unsigned notes/Rx; Earnings MTD
- **Worklists / queues:** Live OPD queue with Call-next + next-patient card (allergies, last visit, vitals, dues); Ward round list (bed, day-of-stay, NEWS2, due meds/results); Results inbox (critical pinned, must-ack); Consult/referral requests; Tasks & unsigned documents; Appointments hub (OPD/tele/home)
- **Alerts:** Critical lab/result unacked; NEWS2 ≥ 7 patient; Drug interaction override pending review; Discharge summary overdue; Emergency dispatch (30s accept window)
- **Quick actions:** Call next, Start consult (EMR workspace), Write Rx, Order set, Start round, Sign discharge, Dictate note
- **Sections / tabs:** My day · OPD · Ward rounds · Results · Orders & Rx · Tele/Home · OT · Earnings · CME
- **Features:** EMR workspace: patient banner (allergies red), timeline, problem list, orders/Rx tabs, ICD-10 search, e-sign + QR; DDI/allergy/dose check (`DdiCheckBanner`) with override reason; Rx templates + favourites, generic substitution control (`noSubstitution`); Auto follow-up booking, care plans; Voice dictation + AI scribe draft (review-then-sign); Teleconsult/home-visit tabs with compliance (RMP no., consent); Earnings & payout statement (TDS); On-call roster, CME tracker
- **Data / APIs:** `/doctor/{dashboard,queue,rounds,tasks,oncall,workspace}`, `/orders/*`, `/ddi/check`, `/clinical/cds/check`, `/search/icd`, `/recall/book`, `/doctor/earnings`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Treating-patient scope; break-glass for others; every PHI view logged.
- **Mobile:** Rounds-first mobile layout, swipe between patients, offline cache.

